        "Content": "EMAIL ENQUIRES ONLY PLEASE - NO PHONE CALLS\r\n\r\nROOM TO RENT BELFRY SQUARE CITYWEST, DUBLIN 24 \r\n\r\nDouble Room | Fully Furnished | Shared Bathroom | Available Now\r\n\r\nA bright and spacious double bedroom is available to rent in a comfortable shared house in Citywest, Dublin 24.\r\n\r\nThe room is fully furnished and includes a comfortable bed, wardrobe and plenty of storage space. The house offers a spacious kitchen, comfortable shared living areas and a large back garden, ideal for relaxing or enjoying outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe property is located in a quiet residential area with excellent transport links and easy access to local amenities.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n•Spacious furnished double bedroom\r\n•One shared bathroom\r\n•Fully furnished house\r\n•Spacious kitchen with modern appliances\r\n•Large back garden\r\n•Comfortable shared living area\r\n•Gas central heating\r\n•Quiet residential area\r\n•Close to LUAS stop\r\n•Easy access to N7, N81 & M50\r\n•Close to Citywest Shopping Centre & The Square\r\n•Close to local amenities, schools and hospital\r\n•Available now\r\n\r\nEMAIL ENQUIRES ONLY PLEASE - NO PHONE CALLS"
